       Bare: {0} = name.
       Description: {0} = name, {1} = description body.
       Position: appends {2} = position suffix (if non-empty).
       Description and position concatenate on top of bare via the
       *.WithDescription / *.WithDescriptionPosition / *.WithPosition
       variants so we don't glue strings. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.Bare>{0}.</RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.Bare>
  <RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.WithDescription>{0}. {1}.</RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.WithDescription>
  <RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.WithPosition>{0}. {1}</RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.WithPosition>
  <RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.WithDescriptionPosition>{0}. {1}. {2}</RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Item.WithDescriptionPosition>

  <!-- Typeahead context (active search prefix on item announcement).
       Prefix: {0} = current search buffer, {1} = item announcement.
       NoMatchesPrefix: {0} = buffer, {1} = item announcement. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Search.Prefix>Search '{0}': {1}</RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Search.Prefix>
  <RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Search.NoMatchesPrefix>No matches for '{0}'. {1}</RimWorldAccess.Sellable.Search.NoMatchesPrefix>

</LanguageData>
